<title>POLAND: POLFA-K MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLFA-K MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.24 vs   1.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.78 vs   2.45</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.65 vs   5.78</p>
<p> Sales		   15.49 vs  15.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.85 vs   4.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.95 vs   7.18</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.20 vs   7.87</p>
<p> Sales		   51.28 vs  45.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish pharmaceuticals firm Polfa Kutno</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
